Hello,

Your differential expression analysis (Job #<%= @job.job_number %>) is complete. <%= question %>

Summary
- Design: <%= @manifest["design"] %>
- Samples analyzed: <%= @manifest["samples"]["in_model"] %>
- Genes tested: <%= genes["tested"] %> of <%= genes["in_input"] %> in your count matrix
- Significant genes: <%= genes["significant"] %><% unless genes["significant_up"].nil? %> (<%= genes["significant_up"] %> higher and <%= genes["significant_down"] %> lower in <%= contrast["test_level"] %>)<% end %>

Attached
